  "intro": "Web application & network penetration testing, vulnerability research va security automation bilan shug'ullanaman.",
  "bio": [
    "Men xavfsizlikning hujum tomonida ishlayman: attack surface'ni xaritaga tushiraman, tajovuzkor undan amalda nima qila olishini isbotlayman va tuzatish yo'li aniq bo'ladigan qilib hisobot yozaman. 1+ yil amaliy tajriba, HackTheBox, TryHackMe va VulNyx'da 20+ mashina.",
    "Har bir engagement OWASP Top 10 va Cyber Kill Chain asosida tuzilib, professional pentest hisoboti bilan yakunlanadi: qayta takrorlash qadamlari, MITRE ATT&CK bog'lanishi, risk reytingi va remediation tavsiyalari. Amalda ekspluatatsiya qilingan sinflar orasida Memcached credential leakage, file upload bypass, Python module hijacking, LFI + log poisoning, KeePass cracking va GTFOBins SUID/sudo privilege escalation bor.",
    "Ishning ikkinchi yarmi — muhandislik. Wordlist generatsiyasi, service fingerprinting va exploit zanjirini Python va Bash bilan avtomatlashtiraman; bu qo'lda enumeration vaqtini ~4 soatdan 90 daqiqadan kamgacha qisqartirdi."
  ],
